   "lines": [
    "# Carrom Crest",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG0\u0001",
    "",
    "### Real carrom physics, a story across 21 lands, and rooms for you and friends. Published on Google Play by Suwexa Gaming.",
    "",
    "Carrom Crest is a carrom board game for Android built in Godot 4. Coins",
    "slide, collide and rebound with custom physics rather than canned",
    "animations. A computer opponent plans real shots by simulating candidate",
    "strikes with the same physics and scoring them against the rules. Players",
    "can take on a World Tour story across 21 lands, solve challenges, or play",
    "friends in online rooms (a small Cloudflare relay joins phones by a 6-digit",
    "code) or over the same Wi-Fi with no internet. Built with AI-assisted",
    "development (Claude Code): I designed the game and directed the build, and",
    "I'm now learning the Godot code behind it.",
    "",
    "Built with Godot · GDScript · Android · Cloudflare Workers · AdMob",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG1\u0001",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG2\u0001",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG3\u0001",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG4\u0001",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG5\u0001",
    "",
    "[Visit](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=dev.carromcrest.game)",
    "[Watch the trailer](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yyYMOQc8jOg)",
    "[Support page](https://suhaanrbr.github.io/)"
   ]
