   "lines": [
    "# Humanora",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG0\u0001",
    "",
    "### An AI writing and study workspace that edits AI-assisted drafts into natural prose while keeping every figure, date and quotation intact.",
    "",
    "Humanora rewrites AI-assisted drafts using Google Gemini, then runs a",
    "meaning check to confirm that the facts, figures and citations survived the",
    "rewrite. Model output is validated before it is used. Around it sits a",
    "toolkit: grammar checker, paraphraser, summarizer, quiz generator, fact",
    "checker, an AI-detector check, readability scoring, a citation generator,",
    "and My Voice, which turns a writer's own samples into a compact style",
    "profile that steers each rewrite. It has accounts, a PostgreSQL database and",
    "usage-based plans. Built with AI-assisted development (Claude Code): I",
    "defined the product and directed the build, and I'm learning how each part",
    "works.",
    "",
    "Built with Next.js · TypeScript · React · Tailwind CSS · PostgreSQL · Google Gemini",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG1\u0001",
    "",
    "[Visit](https://humanora-beryl.vercel.app)",
    "[Source on GitHub](https://github.com/suhaanrbr/humanora)"
   ]
  }
